  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.0: Cursor-based pagination for tools/list, prompts/list, resources/list (optional cursor and pageSize parameters, nextCursor in response). Notification infrastructure with NotificationService and INotificationSender (WebSocket-only, tools/prompts/resources changed notifications). Alphabetic sorting for consistent pagination. 17 new tests (9 pagination + 8 notifications). Zero breaking changes.",
